WEBVTT

NOTE Actual app components with demonstration data. No real sends.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
CME certificate — demonstration

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:11.703
Upload your CME certificate, then review it as a CME Credit.

2
00:00:11.703 --> 00:00:21.091
Match the completion date, hours, category and provider to the certificate.

3
00:00:21.091 --> 00:00:28.416
Add topics that reflect the actual course.

4
00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:36.177
Save, then check the entry in CME Credits.

5
00:00:36.177 --> 00:00:46.800
A topic tag helps the calculator organize hours; it does not prove that a board accepts this course.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.000
Try it with your own records. Review the result.
